    <bpmn:task id="task_pz3w3ydq" name="Set up project history log" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Started testing the DAI Studio MCP additions. Made Test_document.dai the project history: it was empty with role &#39;general&#39;, now set to &#39;progress&#39; (docId 9270e9c5-69f9-455f-aae0-763202104423). Calls used so far: list_documents, get_document, set_document_role, log_step.&#10;Later: the user renamed and moved this file from ~/Desktop/Test_document.dai to ex-vector-craft-gen/progress.dai. The docId stayed the same." dai:agentStatus="done">
