    <bpmn:task id="task_n3u7jb5m" name="Reorganize plan layout" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Plan was a single row about 2,400px wide. Split it into four labelled phase rows (Foundation, World, Gameplay, Polish and ship), each read left to right, now about 970x640. Used one apply_edits batch: group &#39;move&#39; ops plus TextAnnotation labels. Flow order and task ids unchanged." dai:agentStatus="done">
