    <bpmn:task id="task_kmjmn4dd" name="Fix stale window links; rows of 8" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Rebuilding the editor reloaded the dev windows. They came back as Untitled, but Rust still linked them to plan.dai and progress.dai, so MCP kept picking the blank window. (The new check refused to edit it.)&#10;Fixes: +page.svelte always calls setWindowFile(doc.path), so a window loaded without a file clears its link. MCP resolve skips a linked window that reports a different document and opens a new one (shows_other_doc, plus a test).&#10;Also: log_step now wraps rows every 8 steps instead of 6 (ROW_LENGTH; test updated).&#10;Test_document.dai was renamed by the user to ex-vector-craft-gen/progress.dai. Tests: editor 333/333, app 80/80, Rust MCP 21/21." dai:agentStatus="done">
