    <bpmn:task id="task_j99sto7s" name="Group plan into phase containers" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Replaced the 4 empty phase labels with SubProcess containers stacked in one column: 1. Foundation (task_f6438mm0), 2. World (task_tf8f8mye), 3. Gameplay (task_5z8alm27), 4. Polish and ship (task_8nammjww). Flows now run Start → phase 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → Playable build, with each phase&#39;s tasks chained inside it. All 12 saved arrows are straight vertical lines. All 11 plan task ids and statuses are unchanged. get_plan returns them in the same order, each with its phase path. Done as one apply_edits batch, using the new size and move-into-parent with dx/dy." dai:agentStatus="done">
