    <bpmn:task id="task_56nohg7t" name="Fix progress.dai; add set_document_info" dai:notes="2026-11-07: MCP had no way to rename a document or set its description. Added the set_document_info tool (tools.rs: optional name / description, passed to the editor&#39;s existing setMeta; one undo step). Rust MCP tests 21/21. The client picked up the new tool after the dev app restarted.&#10;Used it to rename this document from &#39;Untitled Workflow&#39; to &#39;Vector Craft Progress&#39; and give both documents descriptions. Noted on the first step that Test_document.dai is now ex-vector-craft-gen/progress.dai." dai:agentStatus="done">
