    <bpmn:task id="task_ll5owu00" name="Choose rendering stack" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Confirming the stack: Three.js 0.160.0 as an ES module from cdn.jsdelivr.net through an import map, with no build step. Game logic (noise, world, meshing, raycast, physics) stays free of Three.js so it can be unit-tested with node --test.&#10;Decision record on the plan set to &#39;accepted&#39;, decided 2026-11-07." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_ismqchob">
