    <bpmn:task id="task_gnca4kqw" name="Scaffold project" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Adding index.html (import map, canvas, HUD root), src/ ES modules, package.json (only for &#39;node --test&#39;), README.md and a fixed-step main loop.&#10;Added index.html, src/style.css, src/engine.js (renderer, camera, resize, 60 Hz fixed-step loop that caps a frame at 0.25s), a placeholder src/main.js and package.json (npm test = node --test tests/). Checked that the CDN URL returns 200." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_33rgrru9">
