    <bpmn:task id="task_r5thkctp" name="Block registry" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/blocks.js: ids, names, solid and transparent flags, and flat top/side/bottom colours, plus tests.&#10;src/blocks.js: 10 blocks with solid, opaque, alpha and liquid flags; HOTBAR of 9 blocks; rgb() and css() colour helpers. tests/blocks.test.mjs passes 5/5. npm test is now plain `node --test`, because Node 24 doesn&#39;t accept a folder argument." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_bski7w4f">
