    <bpmn:task id="task_vdjqqqg4" name="World generation" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/noise.js (seeded 2D simplex noise plus fbm) and src/world.js (16x16x64 chunks, heightmap terrain, beaches, water at y=20, trees kept inside their chunk, get/set block, edit tracking), plus tests.&#10;Added src/noise.js (mulberry32, simplex noise, fbm, hash2) and src/world.js (createGenerator, terrainHeight, generateChunk, and a World class with ensure/unload/getBlock/setBlock/surfaceY, edits stored per chunk and reapplied on regeneration, and neighbour chunks marked dirty on border edits). Terrain tuned over a 512x512 area for 3 seeds: about 21-26% water, 8-12% hills above y=32, 1-4% rocky peaks, max height 52. tests/world.test.mjs passes 6/6 (11/11 overall)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_wyb0rgba">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_2vp7c1zc</bpmn:incoming>
