    <bpmn:task id="task_gpxk6ytq" name="Chunk meshing" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/mesher.js: pure typed-array output with face culling, flat per-face shading, per-vertex ambient occlusion with a quad flip, slight per-block colour variation, separate opaque and transparent buffers, and a lowered water surface. Plus tests.&#10;Added src/mesher.js (buildChunkMesh: face culling via faceVisible, per-face shading, 3-neighbour AO with diagonal flip, ±3.5% per-block tint, rgb opaque / rgba transparent buffers, water surface at 0.875) and src/chunks.js (ChunkRenderer: generates 2 and meshes 3 chunks per frame nearest-first, only meshes a chunk once its 4 neighbours exist, remeshAround for instant edit feedback, unloads beyond radius+3, converts sRGB to linear for vertex colours, setLight for day/night). tests/mesher.test.mjs passes 7/7 (18/18 overall); the 2 failures on the first run were bugs in the tests." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_w6oq756l">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_p0655yhb</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_buuvrw0c</bpmn:outgoing>
