    <bpmn:task id="task_bm1msop4" name="Player controller" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/physics.js (Three-free AABB vs voxel collision, moving one axis at a time, with ground and water detection) and src/player.js (pointer lock, mouse look, WASD, Space to jump, Shift to sprint, F to toggle fly, swimming), plus physics tests.&#10;Added src/physics.js (overlapsSolid; moveAxis snaps flush to block faces and refuses moves from inside blocks; step handles walk 4.6 / sprint 7.5 / swim 3 / fly 10 m/s, gravity 28, jump 8.6 for about 1.3 blocks, terminal 40, eased grip, and water sink/swim) and src/player.js (pointer lock look, WASD or arrows, Space, Shift to sprint or descend, F to fly, frozen until spawn terrain loads, eye and look vectors for raycasts). tests/physics.test.mjs passes 7/7 (25/25 overall)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_eta8s8cx">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_buuvrw0c</bpmn:incoming>
