    <bpmn:task id="task_nie59bcp" name="Block interaction" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/raycast.js (Three-free voxel DDA that skips air and water and reports the hit block and the cell in front of it) and src/interact.js (target outline, left click to break, right click to place, never inside the player), plus tests.&#10;Added src/raycast.js (raycast DDA: skips the starting cell, sees through water, returns hit, prev, normal, id and distance to the near face; blocksPlayer for the placement check) and src/interact.js (dark edge outline on the target, left click breaks, right click places, holding repeats every 0.22s, and an edit remeshes the chunks around it straight away). tests/raycast.test.mjs passes 5/5 (30/30 overall). The one failure on the first run was a wrong expected distance in the test." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_9insw264">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_7fwfkmfr</bpmn:incoming>
