    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_7fwfkmfr" sourceRef="task_bm1msop4" targetRef="task_nie59bcp" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_m4bepscx" name="HUD and hotbar" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/hud.js: crosshair, 9-slot hotbar with flat isometric cube swatches (keys 1-9 and the scroll wheel), the selected block&#39;s name, an FPS / position / chunks readout, and a click-to-play overlay with controls and a New world button.&#10;Added src/hud.js: crosshair, hotbar of 9 SVG isometric cube swatches drawn from block colours (glass and water semi-transparent), keys 1-9 and wheel selection with the block name fading after 1.2s, an info panel, and an overlay with the controls table and a New world button that asks for confirmation. Styles are in src/style.css (smaller slots under 600px wide). It gets checked in the browser play test." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_2y63gbab">
