    <bpmn:task id="task_546z7frf" name="Sky, lighting and fog" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/daycycle.js (Three-free: time of day → sky colour, fog colour and light level, keyframed through night, dawn, day and dusk) and src/sky.js (background, distance fog tied to render distance, flat square sun and moon that follow the camera, light applied to chunk materials), plus tests.&#10;Added src/daycycle.js (10-minute day starting at 07:12; keyframes night 0x0b1026 at light 0.3, dawn, day 0x8ec9ff at 1.0, dusk; sun and moon directions; clock()) and src/sky.js (background colour, fog from 46% to 92% of the view distance, flat square sun and moon 400 units out that face the camera and fade below the horizon). The light level scales chunk material colour. tests/daycycle.test.mjs passes 4/4 (34/34 overall). Fixed a float floor bug in clock(), where 06:30 showed as 06:29." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_00tpunpm">
