    <bpmn:task id="task_541xmqay" name="Save and load" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Writing src/storage.js (seed, block edits by chunk, player position, look direction, flying, time and selected block in localStorage; every access wrapped in try/catch; versioned key) and the final src/main.js that wires everything together, saving after edits, every 5s and on page hide. Plus tests with an in-memory storage stub.&#10;Added src/storage.js (key vector-craft:v1; serialize/deserialize check every field and drop bad entries; load/save/clear never throw) and the final src/main.js (seed from save, then ?seed=, then random; dry-land spawn found by ring search; player frozen until its chunk loads; respawn below y=-32; saves 0.8s after an edit, every 5s and on page hide or unload; New world clears the save and reloads, with a flag so the unload save doesn&#39;t write it back). Fixed sky.js: THREE.Fog copies its colour, so it&#39;s now synced each frame; added an underwater blue tint with short fog. tests/storage.test.mjs passes 5/5 (39/39 overall). All src files parse." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_xbsh9j3p">
