    <bpmn:task id="task_298ztco5" name="3x speed demo video" dai:notes="2026-11-07: Made ex-vector-craft-3x.mov from ex-vector-craft.mov (original untouched). ffmpeg isn&#39;t installed, so I used a scratch Swift script with AVFoundation (AVMutableComposition.scaleTimeRange, exported with the HighestQuality preset). 956.4s → 318.8s, still 3834x2100 H.264 with no audio, 654 MB → 198 MB, export took 113s." dai:agentStatus="done">
